{"id":93,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"وَٱلضُّحَىٰ","transliteration":"Wal-ḍuḥā","translation":"By the morning sunlight"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا سَجَىٰ","transliteration":"Wa-al-layli idhā sajā","translation":"and the night when it falls still"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"مَا وَدَّعَكَ رَبُّكَ وَمَا قَلَىٰ","transliteration":"Mā waddaʿaka rabbuka wamā qalā","translation":"Your Lord ˹O Prophet˺ has not abandoned you, nor has He become hateful ˹of you˺"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"وَلَلْءَاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ لَّكَ مِنَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","transliteration":"Walalākhiratu khayrul-laka mina l-ūlā","translation":"And the next life is certainly far better for you than this one"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَلَسَوْفَ يُعْطِيكَ رَبُّكَ فَتَرْضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Walasawfa yuʿ'ṭīka rabbuka fatarḍā","translation":"And ˹surely˺ your Lord will give so much to you that you will be pleased"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"أَلَمْ يَجِدْكَ يَتِيمًۭا فَـَٔاوَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yajid'ka yatīman faāwā","translation":"Did He not find you as an orphan then sheltered you"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"وَوَجَدَكَ ضَآلًّۭا فَهَدَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka ḍāllan fahadā","translation":"Did He not find you unguided then guided you"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَوَجَدَكَ عَآئِلًۭا فَأَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Wawajadaka ʿāilan fa-aghnā","translation":"And did He not find you needy then satisfied your needs"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"فَأَمَّا ٱلْيَتِيمَ فَلَا تَقْهَرْ","transliteration":"Fa-ammā l-yatīma falā taqhar","translation":"So do not oppress the orphan"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا ٱلسَّآئِلَ فَلَا تَنْهَرْ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā s-sāila falā tanhar","translation":"nor repulse the beggar"},{"number":11,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا بِنِعْمَةِ رَبِّكَ فَحَدِّثْ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā biniʿ'mati rabbika faḥaddith","translation":"And proclaim the blessings of your Lord"}]}